B.axr=new A.kc(B.V7,"1 customer \u2022 1 active SA per branch","A customer can have relationships with other branches, but one branch can have only one active owner SA at a time.",null)
B.axq=new A.kc(B.hY,"Relationship protection","Customers entering through an SA QR, invite or referral are treated as an SA relationship. XSA does not proactively turn that relationship into a competitor marketplace.",null)
B.axu=new A.kc(B.oz,"Deal Focus Mode","Protection escalates automatically with real milestones. Booking, official purchase documents and loan stages suppress competing vehicle-purchase ads without asking the customer to confirm a protection popup.",null)
B.Vi=new A.a_(62283,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.axt=new A.kc(B.Vi,"Customer freedom remains","A customer may deliberately Explore Alternatives. XSA does not proactively introduce the idea of leaving an active deal.",null)
B.axp=new A.kc(B.uA,"Purchase Journey Lock","One intended vehicle purchase has one active official booking/financing journey. A genuine second vehicle uses an Additional Vehicle Purchase journey.",null)
B.axv=new A.kc(B.om,"Protected Inquiry","Non-owner SAs may answer public sales questions but cannot request sensitive files, submit an official booking/loan, manage the owner CRM or close the protected case.",null)
B.V2=new A.a_(61975,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.axw=new A.kc(B.V2,"Anti-poaching & anti-bypass","Same-branch non-owner SAs cannot freely initiate an owned private case. Attempts to solicit external contact or sensitive documents can be blocked and audited.",null)
B.Vq=new A.a_(984827,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.axs=new A.kc(B.Vq,"Ownership timeline","Transfers record previous owner, new owner, time, reason and approval. Historical ownership is not silently overwritten.",null)
B.axo=new A.kc(B.uD,"Closed / Delivered cooling","Deal Focus remains for 24 hours after Closed/Delivered, then normal discovery can resume. The customer may still deliberately explore earlier.",null)
